	(descr "Espressif ESP32-PICO-V3 / -V3-02 SiP, LGA-48 7 x 7 mm, P0.50, EP 4.50 C0.5 = GND (49). Land exactly per ESP32-PICO Series Datasheet v1.3 Fig 16 p59 (pads 0.68 x 0.25 R0.05 at +-3.365, copper-defined, mask +0.05 = 0.78 x 0.35; EP solder-mask-defined, mask margin 0); EP paste 16 x 0.75 per Fig 17 p60 (44.7 %); pad paste 1:1 (Fig 17 toe overprint not used, equal volume at a 0.10 mm stencil). Body Fig 14 p56 (7.00, A 0.94). EP vias on the board (DS: 21 x 0.25 on 1.05 / 2.00 grid; here 0.35/0.20 filled+capped via-in-pad, P5). 3D: KiCad stock QFN-48-1EP_7x7mm_P0.5mm_EP5.6x5.6mm (CC-BY-SA 4.0), z scaled to 0.94 mm. Spec hardware/tools/land_specs/LGA-48_7x7mm_P0.5mm_EP_ESP32-PICO.json | V4 (D95): ESP32-PICO-V3: EP land 4.50 C0.5 -> 2.80 (39 %), land holds 3x3 board GND vias at 0.90 (via-in-pad, placed on the board), paste 2x2 1.00 (50 %); 20 lands without a net removed (DS NC 25/35/36/44/45/47/48, VDD_SDIO 26 open per Fig 11, flash pins 30/31 open, unused IO 7/8/11/18/21/27-29/32/33)")
	(tags "ESP32-PICO-V3 ESP32 SiP LGA-48 7x7 0.5mm ELRS in-package flash V4 D95")
